OL,3,AEthiopia and Tigray accuse each of
OL,4,Alaunching offensives, fuelling fears of
OL,5,Anew war
OL,6,
OL,7,FEarlier, the Tigrayan authorities said
OL,8,Ftheir forces had been forced to enter a
OL,9,F"defensive war". The statement followed
OL,10,Freports of drone strikes in Tigray.
OL,12,FThe two-year war in Tigray ended in
OL,13,F2022 - but over recent months both
OL,14,Fsides have been accusing each other of
OL,15,Fviolating a peace deal.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
